    "ruleType": "stratagem",
    "group": "Goretrack Onslaught",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "After an enemy finishes firing in the opponent’s Shooting phase, pick one of your World Eaters Rhino models hit by the attacker and still on one wound or more. Pick a single embarked Khorne Berzerkers unit in that Rhino. It can get out via a Disembark move, then follow up with a Surge move. The second move has a D6+2″ cap. A unit cannot receive both Fury Unleashed and Unrelenting Advance during one phase.",
